      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "text": "不仅仅是钱的问题，这类药品在市场上并不好买，所以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "所以来抢夺的人里也会有感染者。"
