    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紧张的感染者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_005",
      "text": "呃，这个机器，是那个粉头发的小姐早上的时候拜托我们安置的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "啊？早上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "等会，那不是我们刚发现强盗活动，还什么都没发生的时候吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "博士到底都教了她些什么啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绮良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "时间到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的强盗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "你做了什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的强盗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "地陷......啧，是想困住我们吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗野的强盗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "text": "救命！我要被埋住了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的强盗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "小姑娘！你不管其他人的死活了吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的强盗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "就算你把我们都解决掉，村子那边也——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绮良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "好啰嗦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绮良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "我要的是无伤通关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的强盗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绮良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "你们不可能无视我这么明显的诱饵，就算不完全相信，至少也会分一部分人来追击，这就足够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绮良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "用我这个不影响大局的辅助来困住一部分人，削减你们的人数，村子那边留下攻击力比较强的宴，应该就有办法应付。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绮良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "况且还有投影......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绮良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绮良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "等会，我和你解释这么多干什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绮良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "解释自己的计划是反派才会干的事，搞不好就会被翻盘，不行不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的强盗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "text": "你到底在自言自语些什么乱七八糟的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绮良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "中了束缚DEBUFF的人别插嘴！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "text": "嗨，绮良同学，听得到吗~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "喂宴，你别说废话！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赤冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_475_akafyu_1",
      "text": "绮良，干得好！我们这边顺利解决了，你那里怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蜜莓",
      "speakerId": "avg_449_glider_1",
      "text": "绮良你没有受伤吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绮良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "......嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绮良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "没有啦，我没有受伤。这边也很顺利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绮良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绮良",
      "speakerId": "avg_478_kirara_1",
      "text": "一切都在......我的计划之中！"
